# Modbus / RS485

- Master on RS485 (THVD1450 / level-safe). Honor DE·RE timing for the active board profile.
- Verify registers against authoritative docs or confirmed captures (`doc/dse_register_map/`).
- Respect RTU framing/timing; safe timeouts/retries; avoid bus contention.
- CRC/structure validation required. CRC fail ≠ successful poll — do not advance last-good poll.
- Invalid/partial responses: do not interpret as zero measurement; preserve diagnostic evidence.
- Lab profiles (Invendis, EN-Volt) stay explicit — do not merge into DSE blindly.
- Fail closed on writes: CLI/session auth before SCF/control.
- Do not change pin assignments without checking hardware design; do not remove isolation/protection requirements.
- Never claim physical Modbus validation from compile/simulation alone.
